{
  "id": 1325,
  "name": "catching-charm",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "gameplay",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/21/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "もっていると　ほかくクリティカルが\nはっせい　しやすくなる\nふしぎで　あまりゆれない　おまもり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "지니고 있으면 포획 크리티컬이\n나오기 쉬워지는\n이상하고 잘 흔들리지 않는 부적.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "不怎麼會晃動的神奇護符。\n只要帶在身上就會\n更容易出現會心捕捉。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce porte-bonheur permet de stabiliser les Poké Balls\net augmente les chances de réaliser une capture\ncritique.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mysteriöser Glücksbringer, der nur wenig wackelt\nund die Wahrscheinlichkeit erhöht, einen Superfang\nhinzulegen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta la probabilidad de lograr una captura crítica\nal llevarlo equipado. Curiosamente, apenas vibra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Misterioso amuleto che non oscilla molto.\nAumenta la probabilità che si verifichi una\ncattura critica.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Holding it is said to increase the chance of getting a\ncritical catch. Curiously, the charm doesn’t shake much.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "持っていると　ほかくクリティカルが\n発生　しやすくなる\n不思議で　あまりゆれない　おまもり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "带上这个神奇的\n可增强稳定性的护身符，\n就能更容易触发会心捕捉。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta la probabilidad de lograr una captura crítica\nal llevarlo equipado. Curiosamente, apenas vibra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
